From 12cf0382b57b5982d2a3b91d7e9b54f30dd6ed0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 78andyp <drandypowell@live.co.uk>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:50:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [dialogs] Test that GetHandle() does not wait for the GUI
 thread

Calls CGUIDialogExtendedProgressBar::GetHandle() from a worker thread while
nothing processes application messages, which is the situation on system
sleep when the GUI thread is blocked joining the PVR EPG updater. The call
must return at once and leave a TMSG_GUI_DIALOG_OPEN for the window
manager.

With the previous synchronous open the test times out after 5 seconds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
